21:14.790 --> 21:18.209
H-Hey, hold up! Hey, you!

21:18.210 --> 21:20.419
It's important to mingle, too!

21:20.420 --> 21:22.130
Let's go! Let's go!

21:24.050 --> 21:27.800
Damn. Just this once, got that, idiot?

21:33.930 --> 21:36.060
Oh my, what a monstrous home run!

21:36.400 --> 21:39.190
Squad Leader,
we're not playing baseball.

21:39.440 --> 21:41.439
- Get it!
- Do it! There it is!

21:41.440 --> 21:42.900
Do it! Do it!

21:44.450 --> 21:47.320
<i>Why am I keeping score?</i>

21:48.030 --> 21:49.780
Hey! That looks fun!

21:50.240 --> 21:51.240
Huh?

21:51.490 --> 21:53.160
Is this the Lymphatic Vessel?

21:55.660 --> 21:59.880
At your pace, shall we go?

22:10.140 --> 22:14.519
When you sweat beneath the scorching sun

22:14.520 --> 22:18.560
It's cool water we bestow

22:19.480 --> 22:23.819
When colds and influenza spread

22:23.820 --> 22:27.990
We restore you to health

22:28.990 --> 22:33.159
In their own way, all together

22:33.160 --> 22:36.619
Each and every one lives on

22:36.620 --> 22:39.289
Happy good day

22:39.290 --> 22:41.329
This is my wish for you

22:41.330 --> 22:43.419
Even if you slip

22:43.420 --> 22:46.379
Because it's okay, all okay

22:46.380 --> 22:48.719
Happy good day

22:48.720 --> 22:50.799
Let's give a big hurrah

22:50.800 --> 22:52.679
Even if you tumble

22:52.680 --> 22:57.269
Make a smile that says it's all okay

22:57.270 --> 22:59.309
Yesterday's over

22:59.310 --> 23:01.439
Go and deliver the present

23:01.440 --> 23:05.690
At your pace towards the future
